<title>ROMANIA: SOCCER-ROMANIA 8 LIECHTENSTEIN 0 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIA 8 LIECHTENSTEIN 0 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania led Liechtenstein 8-0 in their World Cup group eight qualifying match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Viorel Moldovan 10, Gheorghe Popescu 28, 30, 68, 82, Gheorghe Hagi 47, Dan Petrescu 49, Gheorghe Craioveanu 71</p>
